@startuml
|Customer|
start
:Contact a staff member<
|Staff|
if (Take in rent?) then (Arrange a rental: Branch A)
:Enter id of customer and number of copy;
|WebInterface|
:Submit the request to RentalService;
|RentalService&Database|
:Check for fines and client blocks in the database;
if (Client blocked due to debt?) then (rejection)
|WebInterface|
:Display "Rental not possible: outstanding debt";
|Staff|
:Inform the client of the rejection;
stop
else (no debt)
endif
|RentalService&Database|
repeat
:Check the status of a copy of an item (book or game);
|Staff|
backward: Received "Copy unavailable" please enter the number of another copy;
repeat while (Status is "on rent"?) is (yes) not (no)
|Staff|
if (Customer wants to redeem bonus points?) then (yes)
:Enter number of bonus points;
|RentalService and Database|
:Redeem bonus points and update balance;
|NotificationService|
:Send email regarding updated bonus balance>
|Client|
:Receive email regarding bonus points<
else (no)
endif
|RentalService&Database|
:Create a rental record (client, item copy, staff_id, dates);
else (return an item copy Branch B)
:Enter the item copy number and the return request;
|WebInterface|
:Forward the return request to RentalService;
|RentalService&Database|
:Retrieve information regarding the rental of the item copy;
if (Rental information found?) then (no)
|WebInterface|
:Display "No active rental found">
|Staff|
:Error received<
stop
else (yes)
endif
|RentalService&Database|
:Compare the current date with the return_date (calculateDaysOverdue());
if (Current date is past the return_date?) then (yes)
:Set status to "overdue", calculate and record the fine_amount;
:Register the client's debt and block new rentals;
else (no)
:Set Rental.status = "returned";
endif
|RentalService&Database|
fork
:Update the status of the item copy ("on rent" or "available");
fork again
|NotificationService|
:Send the appropriate email to the client (rental confirmation, return, or fine)>
|Client|
:Receive email notification<
end fork
|WebInterface|
:Display the final result to the staff>
|Staff|
:Receive the result and convey it to the client<
stop
@enduml
